          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```python\nclass Person:\n    count = 0\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.count += 1\n    def getCount(self):\n        return self.count\nclass Student(Person):\n    def change(self):\n        self.count += 1\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    s = Student()\n    print(s.getCount())\n    s.change()\n    print(s.getCount())\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
